   "row": 61,
   "sec": 0,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Ownership:** early **cotton mills** were mostly **Indian-owned** (Bombay, Ahmedabad); **jute mills** in Bengal were mostly **foreign (British)-owned**."
  },
